          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "From `\"freertos/idf_additions.h\"`  \n@brief Deletes a task previously created using xTaskCreateWithCaps() or xTaskCreatePinnedToCoreWithCaps()  \n@note It is recommended to use this API to delete tasks from another task's context, rather than self-deletion. When the task is being deleted, it is vital to ensure that it is not running on another core. This API must not be called from an interrupt context.  \n@param xTaskToDelete A handle to the task to be deleted"
        },
