          "value": "If a higher priority task attempting to obtain a mutex caused a lower priority task to inherit the higher priority task's priority - but the higher priority task then timed out without obtaining the mutex, then the lower priority task will disinherit the priority again - but only down as far as the highest priority task that is still waiting for the mutex (if there were more than one task waiting for the mutex)."
